    "created_at": "2017-06-16T02:05:34Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-06-16T02:05:34Z",
    "body": "I think it's a matter of what default you consider good, and there's no clear right answer, but the spec picked one that is suitable for many cases and not suitable for others. I.e., in some circumstances it makes sense that the playback rate for one piece of media can be transferred to another (your case), but the spec decided that was not a good assumption to make by default for all media.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
