    "created_at": "2017-06-16T02:16:33Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-06-16T02:16:33Z",
    "body": "It's not that bad. Just save the value before setting src, then re-set it after. No need for all those event listeners and mutation observers.\r\n\r\nAnyway, going to close this out, but happy to continue discussing on the closed thread.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
