    "updated_at": "2017-06-16T04:05:42Z",
    "body": "Decent point - it would probably be wise to leave that up to the developer, as you said.\r\n\r\nThen I'll end up providing an option to mirror the one I proposed - `maintainPlaybackRate`.",
